get.description:
One saved estimate: its request, as the engine read it, its result as it was calculated,
never recalculated, and the incidents found since that concern it. Needs the read permission;
not counted.

Whether the data can be relied on now, which publication and engine answer, when the official
sources were last checked, the first day covered and the wrong rates being corrected. No key needed;
the pages /status/ and /coverage/ say more.
